   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2025-07-29",
   "text": "Ban Corporate PACs Act \n This bill prohibits for-profit corporations from establishing or operating a separate segregated political fund (commonly known as a political action committee or PAC). Existing funds must terminate not later than one year after the date of enactment of this bill."
  }
